{"ref":"BDB, נֹ֫עַם","hw":"נֹ֫עַם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֹ֫עַם</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup>ψ 90:17</sup> <strong>delightfulness, pleasantness (</strong>Ecclus <span dir=\"rtl\">נועם תירוש</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 32:6\" href=\"/Psalms.32.6\">32:6</a><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.7\">Zc 11:7</a> + 4 times; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:4\" href=\"/Psalms.27.4\">ψ 27:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:17\" href=\"/Psalms.90.17\">90:17</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>delightfulness</em> of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>: contemplated in temple <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:4\" href=\"/Psalms.27.4\">ψ 27:4</a>, shewn in his favour, <span dir=\"rtl\">וִיהִי נ׳ אדני</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלֵינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:17\" href=\"/Psalms.90.17\">90:17</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  name of one of two symbol. staves <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:7\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.7\">Zc 11:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.10\">10</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>pleasantness</em>, as defining genit.: <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּרְכֵי־נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.17\">Pr 3:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִמְרֵי־נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.26\">15:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.24\">16:24</a>.","next":"BDB, נָ֑עַם","prev":"BDB, נָעֵם"}